{"creditedName":"癖毛 爆男","creatorId":"vndb:s11280","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11280","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11280","name":"癖毛 爆男","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:90896","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"株式会社フェザード","creatorId":"vndb:s37208","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s37208","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s37208","name":"株式会社フェザード","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:90897","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"茶飲","creatorId":"vndb:s7283","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7283","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7283","name":"茶飲 一服","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:90898","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c33557","characterName":"四方山 風花","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18761","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"62674"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6799"],"vndbCharacterId":"c33557"},"originalCharacterName":"四方山 風花","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属：六道学園　2-C　／　学内ファミレスでアルバイト勤務"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"容疑の理由：アリバイが存在しない"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"柊誠一のクラスメイトで、学内の『ファミレス』でアルバイトをしている女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"放課後はアルバイトを中心に活動している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目は大人しく、いかにも気弱そう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実際、性格的には押しに弱く、優柔不断な面がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ、その分優しく、人に気を使う事も出来る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"転校してすぐの誠一と仲良くなれたのも、人を気遣う性格を発揮する場面があった為。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ、事件によって容疑者候補となった時、その性格を利用されて彼女は不当な肉体関係を柊誠一以外と結ぶ事になってしまう。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6799","sourceWorkId":"17181","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属：六道学園2-C / 在学园内的家庭餐厅里打工"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"嫌疑理由：没有不在场证明"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"柊誠一的同学，在学园内的家庭餐厅打工的女孩子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"放学后以打工为中心活动。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外表很内向，看起来真的很柔弱。实际上性格也很柔弱，有着优柔寡断的一面。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"但是，性格因此而很温和，能让人颐指气使。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"和诚一在转校之后立刻关系就熟络起来，也是因为她发挥为人着想的性格的缘故。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"只是，因为事件成为嫌疑犯候补的时候，性格被利用的她和柊誠一以外的人结下了不正当的肉体关系。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18761"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/69/697ea44922831ceffd7a8bf3e7c7ba225719762d414b11bc0471f748f0610138.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b9/b937c8500823d63b9c261f6bbf3350141bb4007d315de659ced5c207768d138e.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"さくらなつみ","creatorId":"vndb:s666","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s666","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s666","name":"岩泉まい(樋口まゆら、樋口まゆ)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:62674:18761:6279:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c33558","characterName":"八女 岬","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18762","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"62674"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6800"],"vndbCharacterId":"c33558"},"originalCharacterName":"八女 岬","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"六道学園　2-C　／　水泳部所属"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"容疑の理由：被害者と対立していた"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"柊誠一のクラスメイトで、水泳部に所属している女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元は武術の経験者だが、武術関連の部活には所属せずに水泳部で身体が衰えない様に運動しているだけ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勝ち気そうで、武術を習得している為か男性にも物怖じしない性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃から武術を続けていたせいで、いわゆる『女の子』らしい物に憧れはあるが、苦手意識も持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"事件後、恋仲になった柊誠一を『犯人』にしようとする人物の脅しで、武術を満足に使う事も出来ずに凌辱されていく。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6800","sourceWorkId":"17181","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属：六道学園2-C / 游泳部"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"嫌疑理由：和被害者对立"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"柊誠一的同学，游泳部所属的女孩子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"原来学习过武术，但没有从属于武术相关的社团，在游泳部为了不让身体衰弱下去地运动着。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格好胜，或许因为学习过武术的原因，连男性都毫不畏惧的性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"从年幼的时候就一直在学习武术的原因，对所谓的像一个“女孩子”的事物抱有憧憬，但也持有着难以应付的意识。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"事件后，因成为了恋人的柊誠一被人威胁要当做“犯人”法办，所以在无法使用武术的情况下遭到了凌辱。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18762"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b5/b52b969a6ca52674eeef46b3c28386f168d755fbdc12a0bf31412ecb4f2364cf.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d6/d65844cb2226b864649e89e6598038ce4c743f7e0da053ccaaf9a9d881f10644.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"ねこ こねこ","creatorId":"vndb:s263","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s263","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s263","name":"儀武 ゆう子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:48306","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c33559","characterName":"美沢 万里","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18763","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"62674"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6801"],"vndbCharacterId":"c33559"},"originalCharacterName":"美沢 万里","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属：六道学園　２－C担任　／　日本史、世界史教師"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"容疑の理由：被害者は教え子で、問題児として非常に困っていたこと"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"柊誠一、ヒロイン達のクラスの担任。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"部活の顧問は行っていない為、放課後は補習を行っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"えこひいきや差別などもせず、教師らしい教師で生徒達からの信頼も厚い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"穏やかで、短気を起こしたりもしないバランスの取れた性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ、仲良くなると少しだけ相手に依存する傾向はあるが、本人はそうはならないようにと自分で一生懸命抑え込もうとする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"事件後、一人で居る事が多くなったところを狙われ、催眠術の餌食にされる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自身でも気付かぬうちに、様々な事を『自分から』行っていく事になる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6801","sourceWorkId":"17181","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属：六道学園2-C担任 / 日本史・世界史教師"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"嫌疑理由：被害者是学生，因为是一名问题少年而非常地头疼"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"柊誠一和女主角们的班主任。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"没有担任社团顾问，放学后进行补习。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不做任何的偏袒和差别对待，作为真正的教师而倍受学生们的信赖。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格平稳，不会急躁的能把持住自己的性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"只是，有着会依靠关系比较好的人的倾向，而本人拼命地压抑着这样的倾向。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"事件后在经常一个人呆着的地方被瞄上，沦为催眠术的俘虏。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在自己都没有意识的情况下，“自己主动”地进行了各种各样的行为。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18763"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6b/6b4cb8c8d5fcd89a5eaa4016fd3fe9c9dc42e5d4cfbb2988a58c45f826e6b104.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ac/ac1096284009e4278f4ccda1dfa732597cecad0914cf0d7b3f16dcb988714168.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"加藤雅美","creatorId":"vndb:s656","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s656","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s656","name":"加藤 雅美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:62674:18763:13773:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c33560","characterName":"十六夜 円","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18765","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"62674"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6803"],"vndbCharacterId":"c33560"},"originalCharacterName":"十六夜 円","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属：六道学園　2-C"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"容疑の理由：被害者と恋人関係だった"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"柊誠一が学園に到着した時、学園内の案内役を務める事になった女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その為、学園に来てしばらく柊誠一と行動を共にする事になる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女はクラスメイトであり、事件の被害者の『恋人』でもあった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"この事は周知の事実で、隠されていなかった為に事件でも容疑を強くかけられる事になる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"やや躁鬱が激しく、無口だと思ったらお喋りだったりとその日、その時によって雰囲気が違うが、基本的には悪意を持って人と接する事は無い女の子。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6803","sourceWorkId":"17181","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属：六道学園2-C"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"嫌疑理由：和被害者是恋人关系"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"柊誠一来到学园的时候，负责担任学园向导的女孩子mask真实性别：男/mask。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因此，在来到学园的一段时间里和柊誠一一起行动。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她不仅是同学，也是事件被害者的“恋人”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为这是人所众知的事实，且无以掩盖的原因嫌疑非常大。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"稍微有些急躁和激动，虽然看上去很寡言但实际却是话很多，虽然和那天的那个时候的气质有些不一样，但基本上是个不会怀着恶意和他人接触的女孩子。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18765"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d6/d6d820a4ff40ffba6dcd3c1d32a76cec15e49dbed6a9688b377555238a087b5b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7c/7c9ca7fdb8880a4d44ec95806d3f322cb4d7d3c9b65f038fcdb66a5e69e1acad.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"野中カオリ","creatorId":"vndb:s106","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s106","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s106","name":"野中 カオリ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:62674:18765:6409:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c33562","characterName":"相沢 百代","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18766","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"62674"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6804"],"vndbCharacterId":"c33562"},"originalCharacterName":"相沢 百代","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属：六道学園　学園長"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"六道学園の学園長。妙齢だが、事務的な印象の強い女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"与えられた役割をしっかりとこなし、六道学園を運営することに全力を注いでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"口調は簡素。また、責任ある立場の為に不用意な発言はせずに、何か問題があった時、公にしずらい『お願い』は遠回しな表現で説明する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『容疑者候補』を集め、その事実をバラした本人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"これによって容疑者の『協力』が盛んになって、事件解決へと繋がる事を望んでいる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6804","sourceWorkId":"17181","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属：六道学園 学園長"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"六道学园的学园长。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽然年方妙龄，但事务性的印象很强的女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"认真地执行着自己该做的事情，为了营运六道学园而注入了全力。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"话语很简洁明了。同时，因为肩负着责任的原因不会作没有准备的发言，一旦出现问题时，对外会使用“申明”的形式委婉地进行说明。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"将嫌疑犯候补聚集在一起，公开了事实的当事人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她希望嫌疑犯们能因此积极地“配合”，从而解决事件。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18766"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/48/48367f6474f1e0f05d112a6f552226fc062ab3b83a7d4d186a568ab7c0faf68f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b7/b764c226bf4165e9cee07518baa9d04abd9adeac58a64208e7734c92e2f9b357.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"浅井晴美","creatorId":"vndb:s518","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s518","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s518","name":"浅井 晴美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:62674:18766:6131:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c33563","characterName":"柊 千香","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18767","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"62674"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6805"],"vndbCharacterId":"c33563"},"originalCharacterName":"柊 千香","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属：柊誠一の妹"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"六道学園に付随する病院で入院している柊誠一の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"産まれながらハンデを背負っていて、現在は病院を抜ける事が出来ない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その為、同世代の子に比べて体つきは細く、かなり幼く見える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誠一に対しては「お兄ちゃん」と呼び、兄妹仲は決して悪く無い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6805","sourceWorkId":"17181","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"关系：柊誠一的妹妹"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"进入六道学園附属医院住院的柊誠一的妹妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"从一出生，身体就患有残障，现在还无法脱离医院生活。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"所以与同龄的孩子相比身体更加纤弱，看上去非常地年幼。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"称呼诚一为「哥哥」，兄妹关系很不错。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18767"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1e/1edd64ee5eb6b56318881bc4fb54f1cc6d50079e4bb997215dd2929c886df16b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/25/2523d7234142838c5c43c81e79ca7e7b01e3ce5592a0019de94314cf91a36ddf.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"鳴海エリカ","creatorId":"vndb:s112","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s112","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s112","name":"鳴海 エリカ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:62674:18767:4489:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c68430","characterName":"柊 誠一","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18764","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"62674"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6802"],"vndbCharacterId":"c68430"},"originalCharacterName":"柊 誠一","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属：六道学園　2-C"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"容疑の理由：転校してから被害者と騒動を起こしていた"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作の主人公。様々な理由から被害者と騒動を起こすことになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その為、今回の事件で自分に対する容疑が強いと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"余計な容疑をかけられたり、噂をされたりする事で『ヒロイン』に迷惑をかけないため、自分から距離を取ることになる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6802","sourceWorkId":"17181","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属：六道学園2-C"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"嫌疑理由：转校后和被害者发生了骚动"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作主人公。因为各种各样的理由和被害者发生了骚动。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因此，他认为这一次的事件自己的嫌疑很重。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为扛着多余的嫌疑，为了不产生流言蜚语给女主角们添麻烦，主动地和她们保持着距离。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18764"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ac/ace71f779cace310cb5487cc7d5d767f4a56a31f83f5e20ebd738bdf0ea3d855.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b7/b77d5662e80a02c700f06d9defc08ca9c7151267460cd8dce714787bd5fcaa4d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c68431","characterName":"九鬼 隆","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18768","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"62674"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6806"],"vndbCharacterId":"c68431"},"originalCharacterName":"九鬼 隆","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属：六道学園　2-C"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園内で王の如く振る舞う男子学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外見通りの腕力と暴力をふるい、自分の敵を悉く打ち倒してきている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"柊誠一とは学園に転入してきた時から妙な因縁があり、いがみ合うような関係になっている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6806","sourceWorkId":"17181","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属：六道学園2-C"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在学园里好像老大一般胡作非为的男学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"正如外表那般，肆意地使用暴力，将自己的敌人悉数打倒。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在柊誠一转入学园的时候因机缘巧合，而成为了仇敌的关系。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18768"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4d/4d18638494f5f3e0b6af61a640a5fc0ada4e353d231d72e9f5dba730c2c214fb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/37/37e892992f6b251f2f2a725ed03e07baacd9de3d02a6fa82be59f2965ee4e443.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c68432","characterName":"朝田 章二","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18769","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"62674"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6808"],"vndbCharacterId":"c68432"},"originalCharacterName":"朝田 章二","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属：六道学園　2-A"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"九鬼の腰巾着と吹聴しているが、九鬼と一緒に居る事は少なく本当のところは判らない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"弱気をくじき、強気に媚びへつらうという性格その物であり、言動は粗野で下品。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いわゆる小物であり、美味しい所だけはかっさらおうとする小悪党。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"八女岬に気があるようだが、彼女からそういった性格の為か徹底的に嫌われており、過去に強引に手を出そうとした時には手痛い反撃も貰った。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その為、現在では「岬ちゃん」などと判りやすい挑発をするだけに留まっている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6808","sourceWorkId":"17181","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属：六道学園2-A"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自我吹嘘为是九鬼的跟班，但因为很少和九鬼在一起所以真假难辨。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"对弱者肆意欺凌，对于强者则卑躬屈膝的性格，言行举止非常粗鲁下流。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"十足的小人物一个，见好处就上的小恶党。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"似乎对八女岬很有好感，但或许是因为她的性格的原因完全被讨厌了，过去有过想要霸王硬上弓却被狠狠地教训了一番的经过。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因此，现在只是停留在称呼「岬酱」等非常明显的挑逗行为的阶段。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18769"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b5/b5717fdfd6873bc36846d489da217212c7f84392e13a4bd76444891d564cfe99.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7a/7a25906c68f710205cf055d8ea8ae09ae70daeb70e3f52b9be2f8d505332beab.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c68433","characterName":"仙場 幸太","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18770","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"62674"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6807"],"vndbCharacterId":"c68433"},"originalCharacterName":"仙場 幸太","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属：学内ファミレス　店長"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学内のファミレスで店長を務める。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"作業は主に調理で、表に出ることはあまり無い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外見は醜悪と言える程であり、太っていて、汚らしい印象を相手に与える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、言動も見た目相応であり、多くの人間が彼と話をすると気持ち悪さを催す。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それでも料理の腕だけはよく、『彼』が作っている事さえ知らなければ、学内で一番上等な食事は『ファミレス』でしか味わえない程の腕を持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"バイトの面接に来た四方山風花が彼を見て驚いたのを切っ掛けに、彼女に対して粘着している。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6807","sourceWorkId":"17181","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属：学园内家庭餐馆店長"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学园内家庭餐馆的店长。工作主要是调理，不怎么露面。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外表可以说到了丑恶的地步，非常肥胖，给人一种脏兮兮的印象。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"同时，言行举止也正如外表，许多人和他说话的时候都非常地恶心。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽然如此，但是料理水平却十分高超，其执掌的家庭餐馆中的料理是学园料理中的无冕之王，其可说是“为人不知幸太男，便称吃货也枉然”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"以来打工面试的四方山風花因为看到他而吓了一跳为契机，经常缠着她。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18770"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5f/5f131b4f54c3f335b13325f5d0e6a0e8f37c909feb61ec12f822a199896fce36.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9ce7b17a556c267c76605fa4bbc0e09fea4041d3b718af1844b2a755ee6eebfc.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c68434","characterName":"奥寺 茂","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18771","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"62674"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6809"],"vndbCharacterId":"c68434"},"originalCharacterName":"奥寺 茂","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属：六道学園　倫理、文系担当教師"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"細身で長身、どう見ても悪党面であり、最初に見た時は非常に不安感を覚える様な外見。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だが、人と接する時は常に笑顔であり、言動は非常に穏やか。その為、いつしか気を許している、そんな人物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美沢万里の同僚であり、同じ社会科系を中心に担当している為、一緒に居る時間も多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目とは裏腹に非常に親切な人物で、人を助ける事その物で満足出来る様な性格をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その為、美沢万里からも信頼が厚く、彼女との仲は悪くない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6809","sourceWorkId":"17181","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属：六道学園 倫理・文系担当教師"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身材高大纤瘦，不论怎么看都是一副坏人的外表，第一眼看上去非常令人不安。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"但是，对人经常满面笑容，举止非常地沉稳。因此是个会令人不知不觉间放下心来的人物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美沢万里的同事，因为同样都是负责社会科系为中心的科目，所以在一起的时间很多。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"和外表相反非常亲切的人物，有着会因为帮助他人而感到满足的性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"所以，美沢万里对他非常信赖，和她的关系很不错。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18771"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/de/de160466c1e95c6a15fc505d2c3a8b18ddf2df148d9b859af039a5d89349d5c8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ee/ee88821e7277c474306